  "description": "On-device coding agent — \"code from my mobile.\" A real read -> propose-edit -> run-command -> observe -> iterate loop driven by the existing CircleAI.Hosting IAIService brain (no cloud, no new model runtime). Hardware-tiered: a capable phone runs a real 3-7B coding model locally; a weak phone reports Unavailable BY DESIGN via the existing SelectionQuality / ModalityPlan selector pattern. Reuses CircleAI.DevTools (ICodeEditor/FileEdit) and CircleAI.CodeUnderstanding (ICodeSearch). Adds the command-runner seam (fail-closed by default) and the coding-model catalogue seam (hash-verified; empty until a real bundle is registered — no faked model).",
